description: Publish every AWGStat change as a new immutable release
alwaysApply: true
---

# Release Every Change

- Every repository change intended for publication must increment `VERSION`.
- Update the version in `VERSION`, `config`, `README.md`, and `CHANGELOG.md`.
- Never overwrite, move, or delete an existing release or tag.
- Commit releases as `Release AWGStat <version>`.
- Build and verify a new `awgstat-<version>.tar.gz` artifact.
- Shell scripts and Python files in release archives must use LF endings.
- Publish the new GitHub release before deploying that exact version.
- Create and verify server backups before every deployment.
